1
00:00:00,709 --> 00:00:01,793
You need support?

2
00:00:01,793 --> 00:00:02,993
The equipment
we have right now

3
00:00:03,211 --> 00:00:04,254
makes it impossible for us

4
00:00:04,796 --> 00:00:06,214
to train, regardless
of skills.

5
00:00:06,381 --> 00:00:09,175
The baseball club will be
shut down anyway

6
00:00:09,467 --> 00:00:11,511
so I don't really understand

7
00:00:11,928 --> 00:00:13,096
why the school should
support you.

8
00:00:13,096 --> 00:00:14,556
We're not getting shut down!

9
00:00:14,931 --> 00:00:17,011
You have no idea how hard
we train to get the result.

10
00:00:20,437 --> 00:00:22,397
Does having equipment
make you better at baseball?

11
00:00:22,605 --> 00:00:23,605
Well...

12
00:00:23,898 --> 00:00:24,898
See!

13
00:00:25,734 --> 00:00:27,444
We can't support you
based on

14
00:00:27,444 --> 00:00:28,611
what you said.

15
00:00:29,446 --> 00:00:30,488
I'm sorry

16
00:00:30,613 --> 00:00:31,613
but we can't...

17
00:00:32,323 --> 00:00:33,323
Please.

18
00:00:34,701 --> 00:00:36,327
Just as you said

19
00:00:36,327 --> 00:00:38,607
we won't necessarily be better
if we change our equipment.

20
00:00:39,456 --> 00:00:40,456
But

21
00:00:41,041 --> 00:00:42,876
we should be able
to do our basics.

22
00:00:43,752 --> 00:00:45,712
If the gloves are torn
we sew them off.

23
00:00:45,962 --> 00:00:47,088
When bats are broken

24
00:00:47,672 --> 00:00:49,424
we share the remaining one.

25
00:00:49,799 --> 00:00:51,593
This tournament may
be our last chance

26
00:00:52,010 --> 00:00:53,553
so please, help us for once

27
00:00:54,095 --> 00:00:55,513
so that we can at least
train well.

28
00:00:57,515 --> 00:00:58,515
Alright.

29
00:01:00,101 --> 00:01:01,101
Really?

30
00:01:01,186 --> 00:01:01,728
But

31
00:01:02,062 --> 00:01:03,146
you must come here alone

32
00:01:03,313 --> 00:01:04,730
and clean up the bathrooms.

33
00:01:05,732 --> 00:01:06,149
Pardon?

34
00:01:06,649 --> 00:01:07,649
Clean up?
